licence fee, no per-seat cost, no subscription, and no registration.

You may use the software in public services and events, including services that
are recorded, streamed or broadcast, and you may charge admission to those
events. Anything you create with the software - your songs, slides, sermons,
service plans and recordings - belongs entirely to you, and this licence makes
no claim on it.

You may make copies of the installer in order to install the software on your
own machines, and to pass it to another church or person for them to install
and use under these same terms.


